// sync_component enum has only ACTIVE_PATIENT, CLINICAL_PROFILE and
// PDF_DOCUMENT, and bcp_audit_log's event_type enum has no reconciliation
// event. Adding either is a schema migration. Until then the record lives
// only in the n8n execution and must be exported for the sign-off.
